      "writtenOn": "2013-01-16T20:13:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "....understand the point...although since sql is already ensuring name is unique, do you think it makes that much difference?  Won\u0027t the same apply to get by id?  And in fact all the other entities too here!?  If it really is better, I\u0027m happy to re-factor",
      "parentUuid": "AAAAM3//i4c\u003d",
      "revId": "7fd3cb636ee2165cdb8204416e8c324e65739a5f",
