      "writtenOn": "2013-01-16T23:20:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think it\u0027s semantically what we want in this case. Because it also raises exceptions when multiple matches are unexpectedly returned, it also prevents us from suppressing our own mistakes when we implement TopLevelDomains or whatever, and suddenly Domain names *aren\u0027t* unique ;)\n\nFor get by primary key, you can actually just do session.query(TableClass).get(some_id) which can be vastly superior because it prevents unnecessarily reloading objects from the database. I\u0027m not aware that we use it at all :(",
      "parentUuid": "AAAAM3//ick\u003d",
